    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91912" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῡτία</span></b> , ἡ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυετία</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Arist.
			<u>GA</u>
			729a12
		</span></i> (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιτύα</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mete.</u>
				381a7
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυετία</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mir.</u>
				835b31
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιτύα</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				149 ii 38
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιτύα</span></b>  is written in <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.11.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάμισος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.700d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φώκης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i> Il.cc., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.552f
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				835b31
			</span></i>: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτὸς γὰρ εὗρε τοῦ
				κακοῦ τὴν πιτύαν</span> (codd. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πητ-</span>) 'he asked for trouble', <i><span class="en">
				Diogenian.
				3.18
			</span></i>, Suid.s.vv. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτός, πητύα</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a sort of junket</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				6.10
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
